{"id":"dytg02ueluzbxvlzmpr8pdkft","title":"Rust 和 C++ 中指针来源的对比","originalTitle":"Pointer Provenance in Rust vs C++","summary":"作者探索了 Rust 中的指针来源（pointer provenance），发现即使指针看起来像是简单的内存地址，编译器也会跟踪其来源以防止意外修改。通过 LLVM IR，作者展示了如何在 Rust 和 C++ 中检查指针来源。在 C++ 中，编译器无法优化包含指针整数转换的代码，而在 Rust 中，开发者可以通过 API 清晰表达其意图。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://sofiabelen.github.io/projects/pointer-provenance-in-rust-vs-cpp/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T18:37:30.823Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T19:08:48.111Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T19:08:48.111Z","category":"languages-runtime","tags":["新项目","教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2081fb4a-7785-4e2c-b397-a5696d51c52d","title":"Rust与C++指针来源管理差异及Miri验证机制分析"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2081fb4a-7785-4e2c-b397-a5696d51c52d","title":"Rust与C++指针来源管理差异及Miri验证机制分析"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fLckdwreRgOs","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}